[23:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'let\'s talk about specs at work because that\'s something that I\'m super excited about. In the 1980s,'

[23:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'computers started transforming the way that we work. And with things like word processing and spreadsheets, there was this huge leap in desktop productivity.'

[23:37] [scene:talk]
