[23:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'computing to those moments so people can keep their hands free and their eyes up. And that\'s where specs can really help people get things done.'

[24:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'So let\'s take a look at some of the enterprise partners that we\'re already working with. So with Salesforce, a field technician can arrive to repair what\'s broken. They can identify what'

[24:17] [scene:talk]
